          "_name": "content4",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"content4\" group=\"Content\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video'&&bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{\n    'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"11\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value>\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.7\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"title col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\">\n                    <b>How Does Quietum Plus Works?</b></h3>\n                <h2 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle align-center mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"><div><b>Whispeara™ </b>is marketed as a dietary supplement designed to support hearing wellness, nervous system function, and overall well-being. Its advertised formula combines six ingredients, including Maca Root, Grape Seed Extract, Green Tea Extract, Capsicum Annuum, Gymnema Sylvestre, and GABA.</div><div><b><br></b></div><div><div><b>✅Supports Overall Hearing Wellness –</b>&nbsp;Whispeara™ is promoted as a supplement for people interested in maintaining everyday hearing wellness. Its combination of botanical extracts and other compounds is marketed to complement general health. However, there is currently insufficient clinical evidence to establish that Whispeara improves hearing or prevents hearing loss.</div><div><b><br></b></div><div><b>✅Provides Antioxidant Support –</b>Grape Seed Extract and Green Tea Extract contain naturally occurring antioxidants, including polyphenols and catechins. These compounds help protect cells against oxidative stress and contribute to the antioxidant properties of the formula.</div></div><div><div><br></div></div><div><div><b>✅Supports Healthy Circulation –</b>&nbsp;Grape Seed Extract contains proanthocyanidins, while Capsicum Annuum contains capsaicinoids. These plant compounds have been studied for their potential effects on vascular function and circulation. Healthy circulation is important for normal body function.</div></div><div><div><br></div></div><div><div><b>✅Promotes Nervous System Wellness– </b>GABA is a naturally occurring neurotransmitter involved in regulating communication between nerve cells. It plays an important role in the nervous system's normal signaling processes and is commonly included in relaxation-focused supplements.</div></div><div><div><br></div></div><div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><b>✅Supports Relaxation and Calmness – </b>GABA is associated with the body's natural calming processes. It is included in Whispeara's advertised formula to complement relaxation and mental wellness. However, research on the benefits of oral GABA supplements remains limited.</span></div></div><div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><br></span></div></div><div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><b>✅Helps Support Everyday Energy –</b>&nbsp;Maca Root has a long history of traditional use as a nutritional botanical. It is commonly included in wellness supplements marketed for stamina, vitality, and everyday energy. Reliable evidence for specific energy-related benefits remains limited.</span></div></div><br><div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><b>✅Provides Plant-Based Nutritional Compounds –</b>&nbsp;Green Tea Extract and Grape Seed Extract provide naturally occurring plant compounds. These ingredients contribute polyphenols and other bioactive substances that researchers continue to investigate for their potential health-related properties.</span></div></div><div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><br></span></div></div><div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><b>✅Complements Metabolic Wellness –</b>&nbsp;Gymnema Sylvestre is traditionally used in Ayurvedic preparations and contains compounds called gymnemic acids. Researchers have investigated its potential relationship with glucose metabolism. Its inclusion does not establish that Whispeara can regulate blood sugar or treat metabolic conditions.</span></div></div><br><div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><b>✅Supports General Cellular Health –</b>&nbsp;Antioxidant compounds found in green tea and grape seed extracts are studied for their role in protecting cells from oxidative damage. Maintaining a balanced diet rich in fruits, vegetables, and essential nutrients is also important for cellular health.</span></div></div><br><div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><b>✅Offers Convenient Daily Supplementation –</b>&nbsp;Whispeara™ is marketed as a convenient liquid supplement that combines several botanical and nutritional ingredients in one formula. Its liquid format may appeal to people who prefer supplements over traditional capsules, depending on the product's directions and serving size.</span></div></div></h2>\n                <div class=\"mbr-section-btn align-center\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\">\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\">LEARN MORE</a>\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-primary-outline\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\">LIVE DEMO</a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
